  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "What is stored",
      "items": [
        "Only profiles.fulltime (Pro or not) and fulltime_at, the first time Pro turned on",
        "Checkout, Activating and the detours are Polar or page states, not database rows",
        "Revoking Pro keeps fulltime_at"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "What moves the plan",
      "items": [
        "Polar customer.state_changed: the webhook re-reads granted benefits and sets Pro to match",
        "An admin can give or take Pro in /admin/users with the same set_pro RPC",
        "Pro is one payment, kept for life; why Polar would remove the benefit is Polar's rule, not this repo's"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Edges of the flow",
      "items": [
        "Closing the checkout changes nothing: the account stays Free and Polar's back link returns to /pricing or /account",
        "A checkout that fails to start returns to the page with ?billing=error",
        "Pro given by hand has no Polar customer, so Manage billing shows ?billing=error",
        "/admin billing counts Pro members without an order"
      ]
    }
  ]
